    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26962" root="طلف" body-key="T">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طلّف عَلَيْهِ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَطْلِيفٌ</span>; (O, K;) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظلّف</span> is a dial. var. thereof; (TA;) <i>He exceeded
it;</i> (O, K;) [meaning a certain number of years;
for] it is like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَرَّفَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَمَّثَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَلَّثَ</span>. (IAar,
TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظلف</span>.)

